# Environment Configuration Examples

## Backend (.env)

```env
# Server Configuration
NODE_ENV=development
PORT=8000

# Database
MONGODB_URI=mongodb://localhost:27017/cricbuzz

# JWT Secrets
ACCESS_TOKEN_SECRET=your_super_secret_access_token_key_change_this_in_production
REFRESH_TOKEN_SECRET=your_super_secret_refresh_token_key_change_this_in_production

# CORS
CORS_ORIGIN=http://localhost:5173

# Google OAuth (Optional)
GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=your-google-client-id
GOOGLE_CLIENT_SECRET=your-google-client-secret
GOOGLE_CALLBACK_URL=http://localhost:3000/api/auth/google/callback

# Logging
LOG_LEVEL=debug

# Upload Configuration
MAX_FILE_SIZE=5242880
UPLOAD_DIR=uploads
```

## Frontend (.env.local - Development)

```env
VITE_API_URL=http://localhost:8000/api
VITE_SOCKET_URL=http://localhost:8000
VITE_ENV=development
```

## Frontend (.env.production - Production)

```env
VITE_API_URL=https://api.cricbuzz.example.com/api
VITE_SOCKET_URL=https://api.cricbuzz.example.com
VITE_ENV=production
```
